<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-06T08:05:45.332Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 08:05:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistani security forces are again confronting Afghan Taliban infiltration along the Kurram border, arresting militants, destroying posts and killing attackers after cross-border fire. In Rawalakot security forces killed 18 protesters, including four children, during demonstrations over basic rights. A bus-truck collision on the Hazara Motorway killed eight and injured 30, while a shop roof collapse on Karachi’s Manghopir Road killed one person. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQd21RU1NkQTBzcWZoSHcxZGdQNnJhZ2ktb1BadFNLcDdsMUN0M0dabEFidU8tSFpUb2xYOUlsbDNHbmFxVlJwQjBRNnF3Y0ZhbC1CQVYzMTdwT0lsRExZYjdmN1JNVjJvRlVIcnRBRDhWSHE3NlBBRDYxbDBNM1FxZDF5Mk9Rdm5xMm5nS09tRFlrMW9XT0lSOUJvZjFFcXJn?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOUVFWUjJHVlZ1QTBGNjdCOW1WZzVtMHN2Y3NRR2NKZHpWOVg5Ym03OHVLVHpPNjJESXhsYVFVMzZBcW40blliLUZrczkwUjBmdHJud1lWMVF0RjdLTXZESy1xTk1QNUQtRUhWdDAzSHNuVkw5enl0QkVCUlg1Z0ZTZjVycVp3TWM1UGFFbWwwblA0Tm9uQU1TM1NvbzV6ZG1C?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE1uem4zbHNmNEJZZmlXOUpwdVFpa3ZSdnQyNHhhdnVsYTl2eDZBbTdQd2prRDRscGwyWEtoVTloeXIxcUgwUG5UeUZUN2VwTlo5S1ZIei05ZS0tT0xWblVVSHh4R1dkMDJBbVBXUTJlaE5rVXdyUHMzWTNrc2wzcWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBJR2lLamZ6QU9keDZtTl9vLU9pcElOT0FrM1A1cC1mdl9lX1lLVHBMQmYteXpRMkhnOTVpV092UVg1dURSYWJGSmlxTkhFSldjTjFPOHJGRExaUHdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBlZklObG9Vdk01OWJnUlpvelYwWTZ2NjBNdEVfQnE4dmFnaDFXNFBn